    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>There rotten apples are mixed accidently with seven good apples,</p><p>And four apples are drawn one by one without replacement.</p><p>Now&nbsp;the random variable X denote the number of rotten apples.</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;represent mean and variance of X, respectively,&nbsp;</p><p>So, now plotting the table of given data we get,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Now mean is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math></p><p>And variance is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, by putting the value from above table we get,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p>"
  }
}